    "date": "2026-11-14",
    "generated_parts": "The block `rgaa`, and the fields `rgaa` and `rgaa_note` of each entry of `wcag`, are rewritten by `python scripts/rgaa_official.py --write` from the official RGAA file of the version named in references/accessibility/rgaa/ACTIVE. Everything else is maintained by hand from the sources below.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "rgaa-json",
        "used_for": "rgaa.criteria: WCAG success criteria listed by each criterion",
        "document": "criteres.json, field references[].wcag (DISIC/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr, commit 95d5ef33 of 2026-01-07)",
        "consulted": "2026-11-14"
      },
      {
        "id": "wcag-22",
